  "description_nl": "Part A from the client master; OtherInformation1 (the CA) from the CA firm's approved application; clause 18 (depreciation), 31(a) (loans accepted), 31(b) (repaid) and 23 (payments to persons in s.40A(2)(b)) from rows mapped '3CD <clause>'. clause_lists says which list each clause fills; skip_zero leaves out a row whose figure is nil there (a loan not repaid has no 31(b) line). The rest stays the schema's default for the department's utility.",
